{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/336611-throwing-large-objects-with-transmutations","id":336611,"title":"Throwing large objects with Transmutations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-10T19:45:14-08:00","id":336611,"title":"Throwing large objects with Transmutations","content":"Hey all,<br /> <br /> I'm playing a Promethean very focused around physical prowess, and have taken the Shoulders of Atlas/Titanic Vigor and Titan's Throw/Weapons of the Gods transmutations. Character presently has Str 4 Dex 3 and Ath 4, so total 11-size for throwing distance, right? The issue we've run into, and been a little miffed on, is how the transmutations interact with the normal throwing rules. For instance, the character can, without using any transmutations other than TV/WotG, lift a full size sedan, which is size 14. According to TT/WotG, he can then throw that same car. However, the car is 3 sizes larger than Str+Dex+Ath. So how does that work? You obviously can't throw things negative distances, but the normal throwing rules seem to greatly limit the usefulness of the throwing transmutations. Has there been any official clarification I'm not aware of, or any common house rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3283-wussydan","name":"WussyDan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T00:31:43-08:00","id":336819,"title":"","content":"Looking at TT/WotG, it looks like it allows you to use your boosted Strength to throw things. So your throwing distance would be 15 - Size with SoA/TT, or 19-Size with TV/WoTG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T02:20:06-08:00","id":336853,"title":"","content":"I haven't looked the rules over recently, but the way I remember it, thats the distance you can throw stuff, without a role. Each success on a Str+Ath roll, will take it an additional yard, I think. Same as with jumping.<br /> Thats how I remember it, anyway. Might be wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T12:01:41-08:00","id":337293,"title":"","content":"I'm having Scion: Throwing flashbacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T21:16:34-08:00","id":337688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/336611-throwing-large-objects-with-transmutations?p=336819#post336819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looking at TT/WotG, it looks like it allows you to use your boosted Strength to throw things. So your throwing distance would be 15 - Size with SoA/TT, or 19-Size with TV/WoTG.</div> </div> </div> </div>That makes a lot of sense, and it's what we thought was intended, it's just not quite clear in the text, so we wanted to see what some other people thought.<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3283-wussydan","name":"WussyDan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-18T19:21:11-08:00","id":344310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"http